{
    "title": "Cars.com \u2013 New & Used Vehicles",
    "description": "Shopping for a new or used car or truck? Download the free Cars.com app and start exploring every possible car for every possible you. With millions of vehicle listings, over 10 million dealership reviews, and the technology to get personalized offers to sell your current car and finance your next one \u2014 the next step in your journey starts here.\r\n\r\nEXPLORE MILLIONS OF CAR LISTINGS\r\nSearch millions of new, used, and certified pre-owned cars for sale. Shop the possibilities of SUVs, pickup trucks, minivans, sedans, EVs, and more. Get tailored recommendations in your area based on your search preferences.\r\n\r\nFIND THE ONE WITH ADVANCED SEARCH\r\nNarrow your search by price, mileage, year, exterior and interior color, features, fuel type, body style, and more to find the exact right vehicle for you.  \r\n\r\n\r\nCHOOSE A TOP-RATED DEALERSHIP\r\nConfidently choose where to buy based on over 10 million dealership reviews. View ratings, read reviews from real shoppers, and quickly get directions to a 5-star dealership.\r\n\r\nKNOW A GREAT DEAL WHEN YOU SEE ONE\r\nKnow when you\u2019re viewing a \u201cGreat Deal\u201d, \u201cGood Deal\u201d, or \u201cFair Price\u201d based on how similar vehicles are priced in your local market. \r\n\r\n\r\nMOVE FAST ON HOT CARS\r\nLook out for our \"Hot Car\" badges to identify popular vehicles you should act fast on, so the car you\u2019ve been dreaming about doesn't get sold before you have time to take it on a test drive.\r\n\r\n\r\nSAVE YOUR FAVORITES\r\nSave your favorite cars and searches. Set up price drop notifications to get alerts any time one of your favorite cars drops in price.\r\n\r\n\r\nSHOP WITH EXPERTS\r\nGet the latest automotive news and expert advice from our Editorial team, watch unbiased and comprehensive video reviews of new models, and read personal vehicle reviews from millions of drivers like you.\r\n\r\nPERSONALIZE YOUR MONTHLY PAYMENT \r\nUse the car loan payment calculator to estimate a budget based on your unique needs., Once you find the right vehicle for you, get personalized payment offers from select dealers. \r\n\r\n\r\nTRACK YOUR CAR\u2019S VALUE\r\nAdd your car to Your Garage to track (and forecast) its market value to know when the time is right to sell.\r\n\r\nGET AN INSTANT OFFER TO SELL YOUR CAR\r\nGet an instant cash offer to sell your current vehicle to a local dealership. All it takes is entering a few details about your car. \r\n\r\n\r\nLIST YOUR CAR ON CARS.COM\r\nCreate a free listing to sell your current vehicle on Cars.com. List to our millions of shoppers, connect with potential buyers and transact completely online.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Shopping for a new or used car or truck? Download the free Cars.com app and start exploring every possible car for every possible you. With millions of vehicle listings, over 10 million dealership reviews, and the technology to get personalized offers to sell your current car and finance your next one \u2014 the next step in your journey starts here.<br><br>EXPLORE MILLIONS OF CAR LISTINGS<br>Search millions of new, used, and certified pre-owned cars for sale. Shop the possibilities of SUVs, pickup trucks, minivans, sedans, EVs, and more. Get tailored recommendations in your area based on your search preferences.<br><br>FIND THE ONE WITH ADVANCED SEARCH<br>Narrow your search by price, mileage, year, exterior and interior color, features, fuel type, body style, and more to find the exact right vehicle for you.  <br><br><br>CHOOSE A TOP-RATED DEALERSHIP<br>Confidently choose where to buy based on over 10 million dealership reviews. View ratings, read reviews from real shoppers, and quickly get directions to a 5-star dealership.<br><br>KNOW A GREAT DEAL WHEN YOU SEE ONE<br>Know when you\u2019re viewing a \u201cGreat Deal\u201d, \u201cGood Deal\u201d, or \u201cFair Price\u201d based on how similar vehicles are priced in your local market. <br><br><br>MOVE FAST ON HOT CARS<br>Look out for our &quot;Hot Car&quot; badges to identify popular vehicles you should act fast on, so the car you\u2019ve been dreaming about doesn&#39;t get sold before you have time to take it on a test drive.<br><br><br>SAVE YOUR FAVORITES<br>Save your favorite cars and searches. Set up price drop notifications to get alerts any time one of your favorite cars drops in price.<br><br><br>SHOP WITH EXPERTS<br>Get the latest automotive news and expert advice from our Editorial team, watch unbiased and comprehensive video reviews of new models, and read personal vehicle reviews from millions of drivers like you.<br><br>PERSONALIZE YOUR MONTHLY PAYMENT <br>Use the car loan payment calculator to estimate a budget based on your unique needs., Once you find the right vehicle for you, get personalized payment offers from select dealers. <br><br><br>TRACK YOUR CAR\u2019S VALUE<br>Add your car to Your Garage to track (and forecast) its market value to know when the time is right to sell.<br><br>GET AN INSTANT OFFER TO SELL YOUR CAR<br>Get an instant cash offer to sell your current vehicle to a local dealership. All it takes is entering a few details about your car. <br><br><br>LIST YOUR CAR ON CARS.COM<br>Create a free listing to sell your current vehicle on Cars.com. List to our millions of shoppers, connect with potential buyers and transact completely online.",
